  unitName: Demon Blade Lico
  unitId: 860005
  unitNumber: 8017
  description: Drawing from her demonic heritage, Lico managed to further infuse
    dark powers into her fearsome dark blade. Convinced that her former sisters-in-arms
    had gained superior powers since their crushing defeat, she rejoined the Battle
    Maidens, taking up arms against the gods once more in hope of experiencing the
    most entertaining battle extravaganza of her lifetime.
  summonDesc: My demon blade's thirsts.<br>Can you provide the sustenance<br>it requires?
  fusionDesc: Such energy... <br>It feeds my dark nature. <br>I like it. Do not stop.
  evoDesc: What's this new power inside me?<br>Fascinating... Shall we test it <br>on
    the battlefield?
